      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "If the whole cycle feels like a dead end, maybe the focus shouldn't be on fixing the whole system, but on finding a way to make the *present* moment less of a drain. Even a tiny act of self-reclamation can be a form of quiet rebellion against the metrics. Consider what you could do for just five minutes that has absolutely nothing to do with work or obligation.",
