      "content": "five minutes of what? music? staring at a wall? it feels pathetic. like im just putting a band-aid on a severed limb. nothing changes. the system is bigger than any little \"rebellion\" i could do in a five minute break. honestly, i think the only way to actually stop the loop is to just... not be a part of it anymore. to actually break the cycle instead of just trying to ignore it.",
